                                                   330 *        Issue HERCULES MESSAGE pointed to by R1, length in R0
                                                   331 *              R2 = return address
                                                   332 ***********************************************************************

000003A0  4900 8298                     00000498   334 MSG      CH    R0,=H'0'               Do we even HAVE a message?
000003A4  07D2                                     335          BNHR  R2                     No, ignore

000003A6  9002 81DC                     000003DC   337          STM   R0,R2,MSGSAVE          Save registers

000003AA  4900 829A                     0000049A   339          CH    R0,=AL2(L'MSGMSG)      Message length within limits?
000003AE  47D0 81B6                     000003B6   340          BNH   MSGOK                  Yes, continue
000003B2  4100 005F                     0000005F   341          LA    R0,L'MSGMSG            No, set to maximum

